{"title":"2606.05165 STRIDE: Training Data Attribution via Sparse Recovery from Subset Perturbations","markdown":{"headingText":"2606.05165 STRIDE: Training Data Attribution via Sparse Recovery from Subset Perturbations","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n- 作者/日期/来源：arXiv:2606.05165（2026-06-03，v1）；Dagli、Harrasse（同等贡献）、Zhang、Draye、Abdullah、Schölkopf、Jin；Jinesis AI Lab（多伦多大学/Vector）与马普所智能系统所等；预印本\n\n- **一句话定位**：把大模型训练数据归因（Training Data Attribution, TDA）从参数空间梯度估计改道到激活空间——学习轻量「转向算子」（steering operators）模拟子集重训练的功能效应，再用压缩感知式稀疏恢复解出单条训练样本的影响。\n\n- **研究问题**：TDA 的金标准是对「增删数据后重训练」的真实因果干预（留一法 LOO、datamodels），但对 LLM 计算上不可行；影响函数类梯度方法依赖局部凸性与收敛假设且需处理数十亿参数；表征相似度方法可扩展但缺因果根据。能否以重训练级精度恢复预训练级 TDA？\n\n- **模型与方法**：形式化：模型 θ*(S) 在 S 上最小化经验风险，响应 r(x;S)=ℓ(x;θ*(S))，集合函数 F_x(A)=r(x;A)，扰动响应 δ_x(A)=F_x(S)−F_x(S∖A)。Assumption 1（可加影响）：δ_x(A)≈Σ_{z_i∈A} w_i(x)，则对 K 个子集与成员矩阵 M∈{0,1}^{K×n} 得线性系统 y_x≈Mw(x)。核心机制：冻结基模型 g_ϕ，第 ℓ 层特征 h_x 经基网络 B_ψ(h_x)∈R^{1×r} 映射后乘子集专属转向阵 a_k∈R^{r×C}，得转向 logits õ_k(x)=o_x+B_ψ(h_x)a_k；三项损失联合训练——保真（在子集样本上改善预测）、稳定（对子集外随机样本与原模型 KL 一致）、线性/LDS 正则（经随机投影 M̃=MR 的岭回归残差，保证响应可加）。查询时一次批量前向得 y_{x,k}=Loss(o_x)−Loss(õ_k(x))，解 Lasso ŵ(x)=argmin ½‖y_x−Mw‖²+λ‖w‖₁。M 由每例随机指派到 d 个子集构成左 d-正则二部图。\n\n- **主要命题/定理**：Lemma 1（扩展图测量稀疏恢复）：若 M 为 (2k,ε)-扩展图的邻接阵且 ε<1/6，则任意 k-稀疏 w 可由 K=O(k log(n/k)) 个子集测量经 ℓ1 最小化精确唯一恢复；最大设定 K=1000、n≈11.4M、k≈50 时 k·log(n/k)≈617；d=O(log(n/k)) 的随机构造以高概率满足扩展性（组合验证不可行，以稠密 Bernoulli M 退化 LDS 作间接证据）。经验结果（单张 H100-80GB）：Nanochat 286M–1.38B 预训练于 Nemotron-ClimbMix、K=256 子集、500 查询，STRIDE 的 LDS 相关 0.158–0.179 全面超过 RDS/TF-IDF/GTE/LoGRA/AirRep（后者在 1.38B 不可行），耗时 9.9h 对 LoGRA 52.3h（5×）、AirRep 116.1h（>12×），峰值显存 8.41GB；SFT（Qwen2.5-0.5B，FLAN/Alpaca/Tulu/SafeRLHF）上 Alpaca、Tulu 最优，FLAN、SafeRLHF 次于 AirRep；数据选择（FLAN 100K、66 任务、unigram F1 49.65）追平最强基线；污染审计（注入 MATH 副本）中 LoGRA 召回 62.1%、并入 STRIDE 升至 74.2%（随机约 1.1%）。\n\n- **在因果研究脉络中的角色**：以「重训练＝干预」的因果语义为锚，把 Schölkopf 组近年「因果 × 基础模型」议程（Jin、Draye 合作线）延伸到数据归因：用激活空间低秩转向逼近功能层面的干预效应，与 2607.18114 的激活干预/转向同属「表征空间因果手术」路线；稀疏恢复与偏置-方差权衡的方法论亦有该组估计理论底色。\n\n- **本文自认的局限/未来工作**：(1) 效果依赖基模型内部激活质量与干预层的选择；(2) 依赖局部线性与可加影响假设，在极端分布偏移或高度非凸的记忆现象下可能失效；(3) 扩展到基于强化学习（RL）的训练目标仍是开放方向。\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":""},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","output-file":"2606.05165.html"},"language":{"toc-title-document":"目录","toc-title-website":"该页面内容","related-formats-title":"其他格式","related-notebooks-title":"笔记本","source-notebooks-prefix":"资源","other-links-title":"其他链接","code-links-title":"代码链接","launch-dev-container-title":"启动 Dev Container","launch-binder-title":"启动 Binder","article-notebook-label":"文章笔记本","notebook-preview-download":"下载笔记本","notebook-preview-download-src":"下载源代码","notebook-preview-back":"返回文章","manuscript-meca-bundle":"MECA 存档","section-tit